[{:db/id "q-12556/selection/48e2c434c03c37045260f68d71fec87de257c003bdfc05feed5e8b269f5d98f9" :answer/id #uuid "c8f00e13-f46e-55d4-a301-95caeeb3edf9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{3}-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12556/selection/b75ac5c21707c05ee3e84950279aa1c71ab21acbd88c75181e2b02dc3064db1c" :answer/id #uuid "3a595f3b-558c-549e-bc94-d8e71083dbf6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{x{e}^{3x}}{3}+\\frac{{e}^{3x}}{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12556/selection/44f3409bb6aae85706816adae07e14c9c044d69128425b807f90b309f23217de" :answer/id #uuid "9395ab32-3df8-5107-8033-180bf6c7e582" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}-\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12556/selection/4b3c74d53342eec0e5bedcc338b1423536478b18448414cfbbe88656d4489807" :answer/id #uuid "05560776-5335-5c6e-96f9-7be86db2e61f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{9}+\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12556/selection/539813c6be1a25fb4d10315f41c469839bfbbc3930e76f259f2361b8920614aa" :answer/id #uuid "890b7915-968a-5b0f-8cea-447fba51280d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{9}-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12556/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5f9d1b6a-b00f-57da-abe7-99ade0090b13" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-12556/selection/48e2c434c03c37045260f68d71fec87de257c003bdfc05feed5e8b269f5d98f9" :answer-field/choices ["q-12556/selection/48e2c434c03c37045260f68d71fec87de257c003bdfc05feed5e8b269f5d98f9" "q-12556/selection/b75ac5c21707c05ee3e84950279aa1c71ab21acbd88c75181e2b02dc3064db1c" "q-12556/selection/44f3409bb6aae85706816adae07e14c9c044d69128425b807f90b309f23217de" "q-12556/selection/4b3c74d53342eec0e5bedcc338b1423536478b18448414cfbbe88656d4489807" "q-12556/selection/539813c6be1a25fb4d10315f41c469839bfbbc3930e76f259f2361b8920614aa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-12556" :question/id #uuid "e777f3e8-463f-5c1e-ba8b-c29f43d954b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-12556" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int x{e}^{-3x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-3x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})-\\int (-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{3})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{3}+\\frac{1}{3}\\int {e}^{-3x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-\\frac{x{e}^{-3x}}{3}-\\frac{{e}^{-3x}}{9}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-12556/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abe88143-989a-5967-bb08-16804e31d948"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-12556"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462/selection/3ae887ac7a9af1d97d4339ba6535ab11e9ad5ac8b9aea1fe254044f0f9edb2fb" :answer/id #uuid "101a293b-16e7-5fa1-8891-58671516218d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3x{e}^{-x}+{e}^{-x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462/selection/c6f9fec8af092e5d3cb06f5b3ffd275c0f26e50b6f105363946ea8cb446040a4" :answer/id #uuid "71d8c500-599b-5467-b3a3-548b3b945772" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3x{e}^{-x}-2{e}^{-x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462/selection/2fa6c9b8764d12a93d98c278f6ad016c67e4eefd49cf309c6ae4dd17196c55d9" :answer/id #uuid "56d9f7d8-cd9a-58b1-9e2c-85faeb8fa44e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{e}^{-x}-3x{e}^{-x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462/selection/9c3972d2b59ad62074c76a6daf1612971bbbe25cfbfb89cc96007cd09daf9985" :answer/id #uuid "10764fdd-cbc4-5197-856c-f9564e50ae27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3x{e}^{-x}-3{e}^{-x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462/selection/d4c5926f6d6864827773043ab40a024ce78887a3368650cb0e3b1cbb1f46b5e0" :answer/id #uuid "5512d239-05f4-5c27-9b97-a1d0ffd427fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{e}^{-x}-x{e}^{-x}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "83884735-6886-51bd-8048-4ca5e51c7f35" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-12462/selection/9c3972d2b59ad62074c76a6daf1612971bbbe25cfbfb89cc96007cd09daf9985" :answer-field/choices ["q-12462/selection/3ae887ac7a9af1d97d4339ba6535ab11e9ad5ac8b9aea1fe254044f0f9edb2fb" "q-12462/selection/c6f9fec8af092e5d3cb06f5b3ffd275c0f26e50b6f105363946ea8cb446040a4" "q-12462/selection/2fa6c9b8764d12a93d98c278f6ad016c67e4eefd49cf309c6ae4dd17196c55d9" "q-12462/selection/9c3972d2b59ad62074c76a6daf1612971bbbe25cfbfb89cc96007cd09daf9985" "q-12462/selection/d4c5926f6d6864827773043ab40a024ce78887a3368650cb0e3b1cbb1f46b5e0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-12462" :question/id #uuid "0d985445-f5e3-506c-9810-a73350d83673" :question/math-academy-id "q-12462" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int 3x{e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int 3x{e}^{-x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=3x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=3 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{-x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=-{e}^{-x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 3x\\cdot {e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =3x\\cdot (-{e}^{-x})-\\int (-{e}^{-x})\\cdot 3\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 3x{e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x & =-3x{e}^{-x}+3\\int {e}^{-x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-3x{e}^{-x}-3{e}^{-x}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-12462/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abe88143-989a-5967-bb08-16804e31d948"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-12462"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289/selection/6c263c275600699ee22d903c1942409678787ba553722c1eda9f46280244cbd2" :answer/id #uuid "43efd533-5f77-59ca-b50a-145922602845" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(x-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289/selection/a7b5d77cb46a0be30bd5b52bb6fbea9f625915302613d344ffdaaa47275e3744" :answer/id #uuid "e261f3fe-1a91-534c-8620-4d32d7951340" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\frac{x}{2})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289/selection/8739fb0b8154cbd85b239242d313952d6e29cc45a152e790b6b523dca7d9dba9" :answer/id #uuid "f36d56c6-1e3e-5e2c-a69e-0775b4a6b46c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(x-\\frac{1}{3})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289/selection/e1ec5f2ec13c0cfc26c32d17d6c19918fa35bafe4305895d2c4e4d7cd966130b" :answer/id #uuid "27e4ce46-31ec-5f0e-9df3-91c5cb45c948" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(2x+\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289/selection/a12f193be253bb073d99b57b42fc2ba3e4b64acf2fbefd96b1c581a9e4f1d3db" :answer/id #uuid "597f490a-9ba9-5e9b-b59e-4e286d47a4a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(x-1)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "952fa8ce-4bff-5364-8f06-e704c9aac9e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114289/selection/6c263c275600699ee22d903c1942409678787ba553722c1eda9f46280244cbd2" :answer-field/choices ["q-114289/selection/6c263c275600699ee22d903c1942409678787ba553722c1eda9f46280244cbd2" "q-114289/selection/a7b5d77cb46a0be30bd5b52bb6fbea9f625915302613d344ffdaaa47275e3744" "q-114289/selection/8739fb0b8154cbd85b239242d313952d6e29cc45a152e790b6b523dca7d9dba9" "q-114289/selection/e1ec5f2ec13c0cfc26c32d17d6c19918fa35bafe4305895d2c4e4d7cd966130b" "q-114289/selection/a12f193be253bb073d99b57b42fc2ba3e4b64acf2fbefd96b1c581a9e4f1d3db"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114289" :question/id #uuid "28cbd3f2-ea47-530d-8403-83a96b31400a" :question/math-academy-id "q-114289" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int x{3}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int x{3}^{x}\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u & =x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′} & ={3}^{x}\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot {3}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\int \\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x{3}^{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{x{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\int \\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{x{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}-\\frac{{3}^{x}}{(\\operatorname{ln}⁡3)^{2}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{{3}^{x}}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3}(x-\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{ln}⁡3})+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114289/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abe88143-989a-5967-bb08-16804e31d948"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114289"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312/selection/9d93cbf77387ef0e415f0fb761f4305c35338417727301dc797a13cbdcaef6e6" :answer/id #uuid "c9d73aac-1a6a-526c-b69a-9a73c4f031fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{15}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312/selection/8aab1b30759708532788c03c0207e652e0568432f0e6c05b4726679b696727e5" :answer/id #uuid "88c38295-5b14-59f8-aa51-d9e4b0fc52b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{25}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312/selection/f2c22608df77b80161f6d5431d7a33f0c5fa8016eb831f048285d1a981b5ed90" :answer/id #uuid "625a042b-bbfc-5944-bea6-b7755588058f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{25}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312/selection/5f892e8ce7b7dd0ed239b822b7e0805c268e9aa9acd75c55fd638e4de047c8d7" :answer/id #uuid "045bba7b-78ea-547e-b99c-4ec72d75b90a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{25}+\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{5}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312/selection/b7089190b49554452af9ac03995c6390779aad8f802b3246abf15c35012a548b" :answer/id #uuid "cc8d40cd-1908-52e7-864b-675227a0471f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{15}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3f5d4375-0a26-5c04-8edc-ae110d5bfe82" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114312/selection/8aab1b30759708532788c03c0207e652e0568432f0e6c05b4726679b696727e5" :answer-field/choices ["q-114312/selection/9d93cbf77387ef0e415f0fb761f4305c35338417727301dc797a13cbdcaef6e6" "q-114312/selection/8aab1b30759708532788c03c0207e652e0568432f0e6c05b4726679b696727e5" "q-114312/selection/f2c22608df77b80161f6d5431d7a33f0c5fa8016eb831f048285d1a981b5ed90" "q-114312/selection/5f892e8ce7b7dd0ed239b822b7e0805c268e9aa9acd75c55fd638e4de047c8d7" "q-114312/selection/b7089190b49554452af9ac03995c6390779aad8f802b3246abf15c35012a548b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114312" :question/id #uuid "7b1d4417-9c57-5a54-b3be-6d8bf2b1b17a" :question/math-academy-id "q-114312" :question/problem "$\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "To solve this integral, we use the by-parts formula, given by\n\n$$\n\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x=uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nWe need to express $\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\text{d}x$ as $\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x.$ Therefore, we set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\, & ⟹\\,v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe substitute the above into the integration by parts formula, and we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5})-\\int (\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5})\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the integral, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\frac{1}{5}\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}+\\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)}{25}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114312/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "bc6023d1-1461-50d1-b939-7e08f2878df4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114312"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676/selection/16d75e9d1478c6dce6bfdf99515281c6cd68bc5d53096e136306a67b4ef74b94" :answer/id #uuid "bf8021b5-25b3-5ddc-a03a-2ba61d727e45" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\pi }{12}+\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676/selection/2780c4e0aee138d4b2bcb5973182bf88baf53d72d678f15747ec497c07eeddac" :answer/id #uuid "9fc92f4d-c3f8-5321-83be-59d4c069871d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\pi }{6}-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676/selection/219a5af85055ba61a1a7774f4781dea6f495ad2ec7f56866cbc9ba59755a9e0a" :answer/id #uuid "c081d225-afb2-51a2-b133-399bc20761fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\pi }{12}+\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676/selection/17383f8107daaf4b6c05f6379c6c1ed21d6a3066b9a9ca4e809292bbffe9d2f6" :answer/id #uuid "36bdbb95-af29-534a-ab06-ac99a3c32095" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\pi }{12}+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676/selection/2d9aae38168c4ca9d9be46f294702db42eca1a21f23efadb5d002561a1bb4343" :answer/id #uuid "2daca730-f599-55fb-b786-247a0673893e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\pi }{6}-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "58a50118-979a-5a42-ba6f-a6c98b399175" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49676/selection/16d75e9d1478c6dce6bfdf99515281c6cd68bc5d53096e136306a67b4ef74b94" :answer-field/choices ["q-49676/selection/16d75e9d1478c6dce6bfdf99515281c6cd68bc5d53096e136306a67b4ef74b94" "q-49676/selection/2780c4e0aee138d4b2bcb5973182bf88baf53d72d678f15747ec497c07eeddac" "q-49676/selection/219a5af85055ba61a1a7774f4781dea6f495ad2ec7f56866cbc9ba59755a9e0a" "q-49676/selection/17383f8107daaf4b6c05f6379c6c1ed21d6a3066b9a9ca4e809292bbffe9d2f6" "q-49676/selection/2d9aae38168c4ca9d9be46f294702db42eca1a21f23efadb5d002561a1bb4343"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49676" :question/id #uuid "125c8345-8a1e-5167-a5cc-007a86e85bc1" :question/math-academy-id "q-49676" :question/problem "Evaluate  ${\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x\\, & ⟹\\,{u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x & ⟹\\,v=-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\int (-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x)\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}+{\\int }_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =-x\\operatorname{cos}⁡x{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2}+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x{|}_{\\pi /6}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =-[\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})] \\\\  & +[\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})] \\\\  & =[\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\cdot 0-\\frac{\\pi }{6}\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}]+[1-\\frac{1}{2}] \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{3}\\pi }{12}+\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-49676/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3aaba0a-3b86-58c3-bbc8-22ced09bc8a8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49676"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-49684"] :question/problem "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{1/3}2x{e}^{3x}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=2x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=2 \\\\ {v}^{′}={e}^{3x} & ⇒ & v=\\frac{{e}^{3x}}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 2x\\cdot {e}^{3x}\\,\\text{d}x & =2x\\cdot \\frac{{e}^{3x}}{3}-\\int (\\frac{{e}^{3x}}{3})\\cdot 2\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}2x{e}^{3x}\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\frac{2}{3}x{e}^{3x}|}_{0}^{1/3}-\\frac{2}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{1/3}{e}^{3x}\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{2}{3}x{e}^{3x}|}_{0}^{1/3}-{\\frac{2}{9}{e}^{3x}|}_{0}^{1/3} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}[\\frac{1}{3}{e}^{3(1/3)}-0\\cdot {e}^{3\\cdot 0}]-\\frac{2}{9}[{e}^{3(1/3)}-{e}^{3\\cdot 0}] \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}[\\frac{e}{3}-0]-\\frac{2}{9}[e-1] \\\\  & =\\frac{2e}{9}-\\frac{2e}{9}+\\frac{2}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330/selection/19d5466e84349f416e7f242f3eae0e8ce9f2558634cf0796beb62f8e60f5ea80" :answer/id #uuid "2b37ad9b-ab53-52e3-a8bd-c3a430e154b3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{6}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330/selection/2aef90071200a7bc65baa2d03f49803233ca7b2dc16865265136281ee914878b" :answer/id #uuid "1aa2ff94-4b00-5696-8eec-7302886cdcbf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330/selection/3089f9a34f7a805d8b2b2d5d51b10dc7aea027e8ec8fd8d06ad11cecf2ba9740" :answer/id #uuid "4246cfea-f630-55c8-891c-9ec77d326fbd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330/selection/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" :answer/id #uuid "14748ca6-cfc1-520b-bb63-25ee92643a3e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330/selection/8de7a84a41666d4612460439d17949f75cc9ba4883ff75d5034a1786c2a06792" :answer/id #uuid "65aa1f21-f7fc-5b3b-83b4-1871cbf23c72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "80892b01-df8b-5dcb-a201-4ce57c2537b1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114330/selection/2aef90071200a7bc65baa2d03f49803233ca7b2dc16865265136281ee914878b" :answer-field/choices ["q-114330/selection/19d5466e84349f416e7f242f3eae0e8ce9f2558634cf0796beb62f8e60f5ea80" "q-114330/selection/2aef90071200a7bc65baa2d03f49803233ca7b2dc16865265136281ee914878b" "q-114330/selection/3089f9a34f7a805d8b2b2d5d51b10dc7aea027e8ec8fd8d06ad11cecf2ba9740" "q-114330/selection/edc901e84f0cdd5174afd49105ac3883566ea0e1e057217fb66083a56cc119ba" "q-114330/selection/8de7a84a41666d4612460439d17949f75cc9ba4883ff75d5034a1786c2a06792"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114330" :question/id #uuid "f87fdb47-4d1a-5129-9877-0624101f079e" :question/math-academy-id "q-114330" :question/problem "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /5}5x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=5x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=5 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x) & ⇒ & v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int 5x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =5x\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}-\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)}{5}\\cdot 5\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /5}5x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /5}-{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /5}+\\frac{1}{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /5} \\\\  & =[\\frac{\\pi }{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{5})-0\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & +\\frac{1}{5}[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{5})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5\\cdot 0)] \\\\  & =(0-0)+\\frac{1}{5}(-1-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-114330/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d3aaba0a-3b86-58c3-bbc8-22ced09bc8a8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114330"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
